  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ピクニックで　子供が使う　カップ。軽くて　丈夫な　素材で　できている。重ねられるので　持ち運びにも　便利。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "피크닉에서 어린이가 사용하는 컵. 가볍고 튼튼한 소재로 만들어져 있다. 겹쳐서 쌓을 수도 있어서 들고 다니기 편하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "小孩子在野餐時使用的水杯。由輕巧而堅固的材料製成。可以堆疊，所以也方便攜帶。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une tasse à pique-nique très légère et solide, destinée aux enfants. On peut les empiler facilement, ce qui les rend faciles à transporter.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Picknicktasse für Kinder besteht aus robustem und leichtem Material. Da sich solche Tassen stapeln lassen, kann man sie bequem überallhin mitnehmen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una taza de pícnic apta para los más peques, hecha de un material ligero pero resistente. Además, al ser apilable, resulta muy cómoda de transportar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tazza da picnic pensata per i bambini. È realizzata con un materiale leggero ma resistente. Essendo impilabile è anche comoda da trasportare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cup for kids to use at picnics. It’s made of light but strong material. It’s stackable, which makes it handy for carrying around.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ピクニックで　子供が使う　カップ。軽くて　丈夫な　素材で　できている。重ねられるので　持ち運びにも　便利。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
